ecommendationid": "122646096", "author": {"steamid": "76561197969602709", "personaname": "J A G", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/JAG115/", "num_games_owned": 482, "num_reviews": 60, "playtime_forever": 1139, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 707, "last_played": 1665429366, "avatar": "8a4e72d621fd936423e49194d259bc58653c43a1"}, "language": "english", "review": "AA game not more and not less. Pretty solid in the core game play with lag of variety and deepness in mechanics. Run, shoot, repeat? Nearly! Sometimes you also get to hold the position and do the arena fights with auto firing turrets, traps, slows, etc. Which is propably the most fun moments. \nIt's great to see they spend some times on 3 different major level designs with a lot of dedication for the Alien franchise. If you are an Aliens fan, this game should definitely bring you some joy here. \nThen again it's a coop-shooter; Don't forget to take some friends with you! Playing alone this game, is way less fun and the simple game play mechanics become even more visible. Especially the use of the soldier class abilities such as healing, rocket launcher, flamethrower and many more become (obviously) most fun in combination. Thus friends to coordinate with are highly needed. Especially when you consider that there is NO VOICE and NO TEXT CHAT in this game. Wtf? We are in 2022. At least a text chat should have been available.", "timestamp_created": 1663875071, "timestamp_updated": 1663875071, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "122642208", "author": {"steamid": "76561198154046503", "personaname": "Theredbaron94", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "http